  "ruleText": "Diet 104.02 Custodian of Records; Inspection, Minutes, and Copies of Records. The office of professional licensure and certification shall make the board's records available in accordance with Plc 103.\n\nSource. #7171, eff 10-3-02; ss by #14152, eff 2-11-25 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Diet 100)",
